attempts.raw:
{
  "text": "To you, who kept the spare chair beside your lamp through every late night, listening not just to the words I spoke but to the silence between them—thank you. You heard every unfinished page, held space for the doubts I couldn’t name, and never turned away. Your quiet presence was the first audience I ever knew. You waited, not for perfection, but for me. This book is yours, in every sentence, in every breath. I write it because you believed in the story before I did. With all my heart, thank you for waiting."
}

